<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.2">
<l>cāmiṭat teṉṉaik kuṟikkoḷ kaṇṭāy</l>
<l rend="indent">caṅkoṭu cakkara mēnti ṉāṉē.</l>
<l>nāmaṭit teṉṉai yaṉēka taṇṭañ</l>
<l rend="indent">ceyvatā niṟparna maṉta markaḷ</l>
<l>pōmiṭat tuṉtiṟat tetta ṉaiyum</l>
<l rend="indent">pukāvaṇṇam niṟpatōr māyai vallai</l>
<l>yāmiṭat tēyuṉṉaic colli vaittēṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Bearer of the discus and conch,</l>
<l rend="indent">look out for me protectively at the time of death!</l>
<l>The attendants of Yama, tongues curled,</l>
<l rend="indent">will continue inflicting many punishments upon me.</l>
<l>At the time of [my] going, nothing at all [of your] virtues</l>
<l rend="indent">will enter [my mind] to remind [me of] you,</l>
<l rend="indent">only the power of māyā will remain.</l>
<l>[Thus] I have spoken about you in the present,</l>
<l rend="indent">Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
